# Result files are run artefacts, not source: a full suite is ~1MB per run and
# every run produces a new one. They are ignored by default so the directory
# still exists in a fresh checkout.
#
# The exception is a deliberate baseline. Name a run `--label baseline` (or
# anything ending `-baseline`) and it stays tracked, so the run everyone diffs
# against travels with the repo.
*
!.gitignore
!*-baseline.json
